{"skill":{"slug":"ai-ppt-generate","displayName":"AI PPT generate"},"version":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1770217225629,"changelog":"- Initial release of ai-ppt-generate: an intelligent tool for generating PPT files based on user themes and content.\n- Allows users to select or customize PPT themes and templates, and provides options to include resource files (pdf, word, txt, etc.).\n- Supports a three-step workflow: querying available themes, generating outlines, and creating final PPT files.\n- Offers API access to query templates, generate outlines, and produce downloadable PPTs.\n- Users can modify outlines in markdown format before generating the final presentation.","changelogSource":"user","license":null,"files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","size":4826,"sha256":"3d2772f67a67bbacd944632867f52879eb20cfdc020e9d6458045c7b4f7014be","contentType":null},{"path":"scripts/ppt_generate.py","size":3538,"sha256":"25074c140f409330eccfed2513cd40d58d823b5cb97bc4479df1675bb2c2f95a","contentType":"text/x-python-script"},{"path":"scripts/ppt_outline_generate.py","size":3088,"sha256":"f0ff5563f5881e3c66b6c4c42c552ad006f34c353666d69469668ba270337bdb","contentType":"text/x-python-script"},{"path":"scripts/ppt_theme_list.py","size":827,"sha256":"bacb1ccdf4a61ba014849df4827c8b4174ac7622b421d885e11ad9025ce8e69f","contentType":"text/x-python-script"},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":2126,"sha256":"ae6304f7fd6a2405a9344d2f50317ac4e8e704d171cb5445ad598b74a999fff6","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"clean","hasWarnings":true,"checkedAt":1789032782005,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"9869d70d483865a4be93efe8e7b8a5399c0c1caf176f0a83490b522b0a47eadc","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/9869d70d483865a4be93efe8e7b8a5399c0c1caf176f0a83490b522b0a47eadc","scanners":{"vt":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","analysis":"Type: OpenClaw Skill\nName: ai-ppt-generate\nVersion: 1.0.0\n\nThe skill bundle integrates with Baidu's AI PPT generation service. All Python scripts (`ppt_generate.py`, `ppt_outline_generate.py`, `ppt_theme_list.py`) communicate with the legitimate Baidu API endpoint `https://qianfan.baidubce.com` and use a `BAIDU_API_KEY` from environment variables for authentication, which is standard practice. While parameters like `resource_url` and `custom_tpl_url` could pose risks if the *Baidu backend* is vulnerable to SSRF, the OpenClaw agent itself does not directly fetch or execute content from these URLs. There is no evidence of data exfiltration, malicious execution, persistence, or prompt injection against the agent in the `SKILL.md`.","source":"palm","checkedAt":1779161310706},"skillspector":{"status":"suspicious","normalizedStatus":"suspicious","score":78,"severity":"HIGH","recommendation":"DO_NOT_INSTALL","issueCount":8,"checkedAt":1789032782005},"llm":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","confidence":"high","summary":"This skill is a straightforward Baidu PPT-generation wrapper, but users should know their prompts, outlines, and document URLs are sent to Baidu.","dimensions":[{"detail":"The skill reads BAIDU_API_KEY and makes HTTPS requests to fixed Baidu Qianfan API endpoints, which is proportionate for a Baidu-hosted PPT generation integration.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The metadata only declares a Python runtime requirement; there are no package install hooks, remote code retrieval steps, or automatic startup behavior.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The workflow is user-directed and uses explicit command examples, though the privacy implications of sending prompt and document URL content to Baidu could be clearer.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"note"},{"detail":"No persistence, privilege escalation, background workers, local file indexing, credential-store access, or destructive file operations were found.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The stated PPT-generation purpose matches the three included scripts: theme listing, outline generation, and PPT generation from an outline.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"ok"}],"guidance":"Install only if you are comfortable using Baidu's Qianfan PPT service and providing a BAIDU_API_KEY. Do not submit confidential prompts, outlines, document URLs, or template URLs unless your organization permits sending that content to Baidu.","findings":"[TP4] expected: The package as a whole implements the documented sequence with separate scripts for theme lookup, outline generation, and final PPT generation, so the individual-script underimplementation concern is not supported by the full artifact.\n[LP3] expected: The skill needs an API key and network access for its stated Baidu service integration; lack of explicit permission scoping is a documentation weakness, not evidence of hidden or excessive behavior in the artifact.\n[SQP-2] expected: User prompts, outlines, titles, and optional resource or template URLs are sent to Baidu, which is central to the feature; the skill should disclose this more plainly to users.\n[E1] expected: The external transmissions go to hardcoded Baidu Qianfan PPT API endpoints and use user-supplied generation parameters, with no unrelated exfiltration path found.","agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1789032782005}}}}}